        <mxCell id="ui" value="&lt;b&gt;MainDialog + supporting dialogs&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Start / pause / clear; volume selection&lt;br&gt;Timer: totals, queue count, SSD estimates&lt;br&gt;Options, process statistics, log viewer" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EAF0FA;strokeColor=#45658B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#20354A;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
