        <mxCell id="driver" value="&lt;b&gt;SsdSpy minifilter / FltMgr&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;External driver: ssdspy.sys&lt;br&gt;FilterSendMessage / GetMiniSpyLog&lt;br&gt;Contract: minispy.h LOG_RECORD" style="rounded=1;arcSize=8;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EDF1F5;strokeColor=#667789;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#20354A;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontSize=17;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=16;" vertex="1" parent="1">
